{"title":"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>While finding the sine of a certain angle, an absent-minded professor failed to notice that his calculator was not in the correct angular mode. He was lucky to get the right answer. The two least positive real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which the sine of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> degrees is the same as the sine of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> radians are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/d/74da2e90d61c002078fc6a1509110b74e4b81aed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m\\pi}{n-\\pi}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"33\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/2/28288111ce77cb0ee7ae7353fb1ce5c7eeaef37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{p\\pi}{q+\\pi}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"44\" height=\"36\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are positive integers. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/0/740b7804fdc9546a926406b6b1e2b10490f85a06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n+p+q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> degrees is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/a/a8a3eeadf344c75fb40d2455fe3bcc5deb5feab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\pi x}{180}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"34\" /> radians. Also, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/e/6fef714128e717f65d8c5a0f447c3279d59ff2ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha \\in \\left[0 , \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"79\" height=\"33\" />, the two least positive angles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/f/5bff49e15f2fd902052d35cd766487b16f7d8f5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta &gt; \\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/6/ad6686f50de92a9f17f173d3b4f18c2aa0a266f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{\\theta} = \\sin{\\alpha}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/0369c6860af6c6289e966c241aa8b919b8fd9ab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta = \\pi-\\alpha$\" width=\"77\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e20fe7bb26c08abbf1e18090d4792f50a024c64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta = 2\\pi + \\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Clearly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/9/a29214251734590e161e8be5078bcc15b9cc07de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; \\frac{\\pi x}{180}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"68\" height=\"34\" /> for positive real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/0369c6860af6c6289e966c241aa8b919b8fd9ab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta = \\pi-\\alpha$\" width=\"77\" height=\"13\" /> yields: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/2/f9299f26b11bdf5f11f06412a6d31568f02c58f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\pi - \\frac{\\pi x}{180} \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{180\\pi}{180+\\pi} \\Rightarrow (p,q) = (180,180)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"394\" height=\"39\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e20fe7bb26c08abbf1e18090d4792f50a024c64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta = 2\\pi + \\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" /> yields: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/3/1e380718b2a55ee638052b6cce1355ea333bf9d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2\\pi + \\frac{\\pi x}{180} \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{360\\pi}{180-\\pi} \\Rightarrow (m,n) = (360,180)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"412\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/8/bd89453d4756b22f36ca9523cee9ed69830e87ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n+p+q = \\boxed{900}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"174\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first case is when the two angles, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/a/a8a3eeadf344c75fb40d2455fe3bcc5deb5feab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\pi x}{180}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"34\" />, are coterminal. The second case is when they are reflections of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> axis.\n</p><p>1. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/6/2462f07ddac2dad741f539956a0b59b6f852dc41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+2\\pi a = \\frac{\\pi x}{180}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"116\" height=\"33\" /> for any integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/e/9ce062a8aa76e8192ddc7f49b4a0d4b402c84a60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{360\\pi a }{\\pi -180}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"97\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>2. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/3/0a3e01878160c01454aab1ef822c3d9b5af9444f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2b+1)\\pi -x = \\frac{\\pi x}{180}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"159\" height=\"33\" /> for any integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/a/bcad6a3ec237212049f6ca6978ac1102d1cfe175.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{180(2b+1)\\pi}{\\pi + 180}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"137\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Choosing carefully <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> such that it's the minimum gives the answer same as above.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II\" title=\"2002 AIME II\">2002 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2002\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017001932\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 248/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1808/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 130/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6364/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.725      1 -total\n 58.70%    7.470      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.65%    5.046      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3119:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017001932 and revision id 126424. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}